#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:1
msgid "Baoshan Industrial Park"
msgstr "바오산 산업단지"

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:4
msgid "宝山工业园区"
msgstr "宝山工业园区"

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:6
msgid "Technology park | Baoshan | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "과학기술단지 | 바오산구 | 연구 확인일 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Industry, Hardware AI."
msgstr "AI 및 산업 분야: 산업, AI 하드웨어."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:10
msgid ""
"The park committee publishes an official contact and provides industrial "
"admission, project attraction, policy coordination and business services. "
"This is a separate park from the Gucun robot industrial park."
msgstr "단지 관리위원회가 공식 창구를 운영하며 산업 입주, 투자 유치, 정책 조율, 기업 지원 서비스를 제공합니다. 구춘 로봇 산업단지와는 별개의 단지입니다."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S020 "
"<https://xxgk.shbsq.gov.cn/department.html?infoid=502d938e-44e4-4afb-8e7f-6be0dc1ef20d>`_. "
"信息公开机构_上海市宝山区人民政府门户网站."
msgstr "`근거 S020 <https://xxgk.shbsq.gov.cn/department.html?infoid=502d938e-44e4-4afb-8e7f-6be0dc1ef20d>`_. 信息公开机构_上海市宝山区人民政府门户网站."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "현황 및 지원 내역"

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "기관 정보 확인됨·현재 모집 여부 확인 필요"

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "본 항목에 대해 공인된 정액 현금 보조금, 수수료 감면 또는 지분율 조건이 확인되지 않았습니다. 현재 유효한 공식 서면 제안서를 요청하십시오."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "연락처 및 위치"

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://xxgk.shbsq.gov.cn/department.html?infoid=502d938e-44e4-4afb-8e7f-6be0dc1ef20d>`_"
msgstr "`공식 근거 및 주관 부처 창구 <https://xxgk.shbsq.gov.cn/department.html?infoid=502d938e-44e4-4afb-8e7f-6be0dc1ef20d>`_"

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:26
msgid "Telephone: +86 21 66879800."
msgstr "전화: +86 21 66879800."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:28
msgid "Published address: 1688 Jinshi Road, Baoshan."
msgstr "공개 주소: 바오산구 진스루 1688호."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "지도상 좌표는 구 또는 캠퍼스의 대표 앵커를 사용하며, 검증된 실제 사무실 위치가 아닙니다."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "신청 워크플로"

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "편집자 작성 신청 체크리스트입니다. 실제 절차는 최신 공식 공고 또는 협약서의 규정이 우선합니다."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:37
msgid ""
"Describe the prototype, required equipment, process and testing needs."
msgstr "시제품과 필요한 장비, 공정, 시험 항목을 설명합니다."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:39
msgid "Ask for a technical review, facility visit and itemized quotation."
msgstr "기술 검토, 시설 방문, 항목별 견적을 요청합니다."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:41
msgid ""
"Agree access, safety, sample and IP ownership, test scope and acceptance."
msgstr "이용 조건, 안전 책임, 시료·지식재산권 귀속, 시험 범위와 검수 기준을 합의합니다."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:43
msgid ""
"Separate the facility contract from investment or public-funding "
"applications."
msgstr "시설 이용 계약은 투자나 공공 지원금 신청과 별도로 진행합니다."

#: ../../entities/baoshan-industrial.rst:45
msgid ":doc:`Baoshan district route </districts/baoshan>`"
msgstr ":doc:`바오산구 경로 안내 </districts/baoshan>`"
